s\\\":[\\\"Completed personal study of soil-worksite-assessment.\\\",\\\"Completed the paid physical examination of (13,25) and reviewed its recorded limitation.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Dated finding planting-site:13:25, supported by event-32-sol-188.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"No further evidence is required for this bounded assessment goal.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Use the compatibility finding to guide a separate bounded surface-preparation investigation.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The examination identified a current placement limitation before any root was committed; no physical improvement was demonstrated.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"bounded-soil-preparation-investigation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can bounded manual displacement of local cover help prepare a small footprint, and what residue remains afterward?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"The examined footprint (13,25) is vegetated forest floor and is not currently eligible for root placement.\\\",\\\"The preparation interface describes finite cover displacement with all displaced residue retained inside the original boundary; remaining cover or residue prevents entire-footprint eligibility.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Sol has not yet learned or physically tested this preparation capability. Actual changes and any subsequent residue-transfer feasibility remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Learn the preparation capability, then assess whether one bounded physical trial is worthwhile without consuming planting material.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Personal learning followed by a separately authorized physical trial and observation.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Learn small-soil-patch-preparation, then review the next bounded action.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"No physical preparation or planting benefit demonstrated.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

